#==============================================================================================
#
#   path_convexity - whether a path is convex, and whether it is a rectangle
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Skia m144 src/core/SkPathPriv.cpp: ComputeConvexity with its Convexicator
#       (the scan converters take faster, differently rounding paths for convex paths, so
#       the answer must be Skia's) and IsRectContour with trivial_rect (SkPathRaw::isRect,
#       which lets the analytic AA converter blit a fat rectangle directly).
